From c8dc937853d555d9448db8528fcd8169d1409448 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Ludovic Henry <git@ludovic.dev>
Date: Wed, 26 Aug 2026 15:31:11 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] Package the libaec (SZIP) licence with the wheels

The Linux wheels bundle libaec -- h5py/hdf5-manylinux builds it into the
manylinux/musllinux images and HDF5 is configured there with
HDF5_ENABLE_SZIP_SUPPORT=ON, so auditwheel vendors libaec.so and libsz.so
into h5py.libs. libaec is BSD-2-Clause and clause 2 requires the copyright
notice to be reproduced in binary redistributions, but the wheel only ships
h5py's own LICENSE plus the licences under licenses/.

Add the libaec 1.1.4 licence text as licenses/libaec.txt -- pyproject.toml
already declares `license-files = [..., "licenses/*"]`, so it lands in
dist-info/licenses/ with no packaging change -- and quote it in
docs/licenses.rst beside the other bundled projects.

Upstream-Status: To upstream [same gap affects upstream's own manylinux/musllinux wheels; not yet submitted to h5py/h5py]
---
 docs/licenses.rst   | 30 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 licenses/libaec.txt | 24 ++++++++++++++++++++++++
 2 files changed, 54 insertions(+)
 create mode 100644 licenses/libaec.txt

diff --git a/docs/licenses.rst b/docs/licenses.rst
index 62b888c..fde2c80 100644
--- a/docs/licenses.rst
+++ b/docs/licenses.rst
@@ -113,6 +113,36 @@ HDF5 Copyright Statement
     Government or the University of California, and shall not be used for
     advertising or product endorsement purposes.
 
